<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA ALL OUT FOR 237 IN FIRST INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA ALL OUT FOR 237 IN FIRST INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 237 on the second day of the third and final cricket test against South Africa at Kanpur's Green Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 (S.Tendulkar 61, W.Raman 57, N.Mongia 41, S.Ganguly 39, P.Adams 6-55, H.Cronje 2-11, B.McMillan 2-40) vs South Africa.</p>
